        "original_id": "2d32ca4a-7a8d-5502-8967-06ca4f67d4fc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2014 Australian counter-terrorism raids\n- Places: Goulburn Correctional Centre, High Risk Management Centre (SuperMax)\n- Concepts: AA security risk, remand, highest security prison in Australia\n\nFacts:\n- The High Risk Management Centre at Goulburn Correctional Centre, commonly called the SuperMax, opened in September 2001.\n- After the 2014 Australian counter-terrorism raids, one of the two arrestees was held on remand at Australia’s highest security prison.\n- That arrestee was considered an \"AA\" security risk and became one of only two men on remand there.",
